purpose deleteTodoHandler "DELETE /api/todos/:id — delete the todo with that id IF the session user owns it. WHERE id = ? AND user_id = ? makes cross-user deletes a no-op rather than an error."
invariant deleteTodoHandler "user_id comes from the session, never from the URL. A delete on a row owned by another user produces zero affected rows and returns 200 — the response is intentionally idempotent and does NOT leak existence (no 404 vs 200 oracle)."

