arg writeUncompleteDbUnavailableCall response response
arg writeUncompleteDbUnavailableCall status httpStatusInternalServerError
arg writeUncompleteDbUnavailableCall messageBody uncompleteDbUnavailableBody
run writeUncompleteDbUnavailableCall
